  "bio": [
    "Zhu Shuangquan is the chairman of Hubei Dinglong, a maker of semiconductor materials such as used in display and chemical mechanical polishing.",
    "He cofounded Dinglong in 2000 in Wuhan, Hubei province with his brother, Shunquan, who serves as its CEO.",
    "The company went public on the Shenzhen Growth Enterprise Market for high-tech startups in 2010.",
    "Prior to Dinglong, Shuangquan did stints at the Hubei Federation of Trade Unions and a state-owned company in international trade and business."
